--TEST--
"integrated_stylesheets" prepend stylesheet
--DEPRECATION--
Since twig/twig 3.12: The "tag" constructor argument of the "Integrated\Bundle\AssetBundle\Twig\Node\AssetNode" class is deprecated and ignored (check which TokenParser class set it to "integrated_stylesheets"), the tag is now automatically set by the Parser when needed.
Since twig/twig 3.12: The "tag" constructor argument of the "Integrated\Bundle\AssetBundle\Twig\Node\AssetNode" class is deprecated and ignored (check which TokenParser class set it to "integrated_stylesheets"), the tag is now automatically set by the Parser when needed.
--TEMPLATE--
{% integrated_stylesheets mode='append'
    'style2.css' %}
{% endintegrated_stylesheets %}

{% integrated_stylesheets mode='prepend'
   'style.css' %}
{% endintegrated_stylesheets %}

{{ integrated_stylesheets() }}
--DATA--
return array()
--EXPECT--
<link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="/style.css" />
<link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="/style2.css" />
